OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree: Major public safety
OL,4,Aoperation under way as NI Secretary
OL,5,Aappeals for calm
OL,6,
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,8,FBryant urged calm and said "everyone
OL,9,Facross Northern Ireland wants a
OL,10,Fpeaceful resolution to the situation".
OL,12,FOn Wednesday, the PSNI chief constable
OL,13,Fsaid there would be an investigation
OL,14,Fafter protesters blocked the mainly
OL,15,Fnationalist road to prevent an Orange
OL,16,FOrder parade from happening.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
